                <pb facs="0566" n="556" sameAs="frus:frus1948v08/pg556"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">893.50 Recovery/6–2148: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Stuart</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nanking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1948-06-21T17:00:00+09:00">June 21, 1948—5
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received June 21—6:36 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1105. ReDeptel 861, June 9. Embassy anxiously awaiting promised revised text of
                    article III of bilateral for presentation to Chinese.</p>
                <p>Repeated to Shanghai 501.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stuart</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
